'''Demonic gorillas''' are powerful creatures found in the [[Crash Site Cavern]]. Two of them are fought during [[Monkey Madness II]], in the penultimate stage of the fight. After the quest is completed, more demonic gorillas can be found in the caverns alongside their [[Tortured gorilla|tortured]] brethren. They are primarily killed for their [[zenyte shard]] and [[ballista]] component drops.

Demonic gorillas count as [[monkey]]s and [[black demons]] for the progression of [[Slayer task]]s. As they are demons, they are susceptible to the effects of [[demonbane weapons]], excluding [[holy water]]. Demonic gorillas '''cannot''' be damaged with a [[Dwarf multicannon]].

Players can check their kill count by reading [[Gravestone (Tree Gnome Stronghold)|Nieve's gravestone]] next to [[Lumo]] at the opening in the fence.

